{"id":"076e69cbf2d46206","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-provability-sigma1.md","title":"fact-provability-sigma1 — The Selected Provability Formula Is Sigma 1","display":"fact-provability-sigma1 — The Selected Provability Formula Is Sigma_1","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-provability-sigma1","aliases":["92-fact-provability-sigma1"],"display":"fact-provability-sigma1 — The Selected Provability Formula Is Sigma_1","source":"第 V 章 p. 74；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 91、123–124）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-provability-sigma1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-provability-sigma1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-provability-sigma1 — The Selected Provability Formula Is Sigma_1"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 p. 74；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 91、123–124）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_G=\\exists v_1\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\">\\(B_G=\\exists v_1\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> 为已选定的证明与可证性公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1\\)</span> 是同时实例操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> 按逻辑等价闭包定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}provability\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B_G;v_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}provability\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B_G;v_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在量词块与原有 Σ₁ 存在块可以合并；无捕获变量改名及实例操作保持逻辑等价，因而保持这里的 Σ₁ 上界。不需要假定裸证明关系的表示公式为 Δ₀。</p>\n<p>该相等式是选定构造器的确切字符定义。不能把 Inst 操作擅自替成 Subst 操作的字面相等式；二者可能因确定性 α 改名而给出不同字符串和编号。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 p. 74；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 91、123–124）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"B_G=\\exists v_1\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}provability\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)=\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B_G;v_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G.","display":true}],"bytes":1514,"backlinks":[{"id":"c4f0c170aff0bb4a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"645ee8d3e395cd8f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b0cf42030c298d08","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-374","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]"}],"outgoing":["e9cc91aaee998c7b","8fd1dce21b2c65db","8bd18c4d476f594a"]}